  "body": "This mainly stems from https://github.com/whatwg/console/issues/88#issuecomment-294854936 but yeah, we should probably formalize how we set and retrieve count labels, and [infra's map](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#maps) seems like the way to do it.\r\n\r\nIf someone wanted to take a stab at this, I'd suggest getting a little familiar with that data structure a bit. In this spec specifically, good examples of its usage can be found in the section specifying the [timer methods](https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#timing).\r\n\r\nHmm, maybe @musgravejw wants to have a go?",
